      "text": "Phillipsport’s United Methodist Church was built in 1823, while the Bloomingburg Reformed Church dates to 1820 and now serves as a county historic landmark.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
